{"id":"n57383-1-8","stage":5,"title":"민족주의 · 民族主义","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57383-1-8-1","ko":"세계화 시대를 맞이하여 우리들이 추구해야 할 바람직한 민족주의의 방향은 어떤 것일까요?","zh":"面对全球化时代，我们应当追求怎样的理想民族主义方向呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세계화","meaning":"全球化","explanation":"세계화：全球化。","readings":[{"term":"세계화","audio":"/audio/c5d51b0798082a8acaf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64071","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세계화","audio":"/audio/c5d51b0798082a8acaf2.mp3"}},{"text":"시대를","meaning":"时代，当代","explanation":"시대：时代，当代；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시대","audio":"/audio/0ba34ab95fbb912ac3c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65119","senseId":"2","lemma":"시대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시대를","audio":"/audio/a371b63165524dbe2d63.mp3"}},{"text":"맞이하여","meaning":"迎接，迎","explanation":"맞이하다：迎接，迎；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞이하다","audio":"/audio/fac1f9a42f0b19eaedb8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15924","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞이하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞이하여","audio":"/audio/a397b902d4060525e170.mp3"}},{"text":"우리들이","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리들이","audio":"/audio/0a7ad3d28ae7ed14a99d.mp3"}},{"text":"추구해야","meaning":"追求","explanation":"추구하다：追求；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"추구하다","audio":"/audio/ec58dce3189537184df6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79506","senseId":"1","lemma":"추구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추구해야","audio":"/audio/0eef1ea1dd5f70a4e046.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"바람직한","meaning":"妥当，可取","explanation":"바람직하다：妥当，可取；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"바람직하다","audio":"/audio/3a57390192c14383c4c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15806","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람직한","audio":"/audio/04f15657c40da99e85e5.mp3"}},{"text":"민족주의의","meaning":"民族主义","explanation":"민족주의：民族主义；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"민족주의","audio":"/audio/62ec56ccb0774e25bb22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57383","senseId":"1","lemma":"민족주의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민족주의의","audio":"/audio/d4f1b3cf9633e306cc6d.mp3"}},{"text":"방향은","meaning":"方向，思路","explanation":"방향：方向，思路；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방향","audio":"/audio/d7895d7647666fe00cec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65533","senseId":"2","lemma":"방향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방향은","audio":"/audio/a2ec591eca46df52698c.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"것일까요?","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것일까요","audio":"/audio/9d5b2e08c4cfb3bca933.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c5d51b0798082a8a","term":"세계화","zh":"全球化","audio":"/audio/c5d51b0798082a8acaf2.mp3","entryId":"64071","definition":"理解世界各国，面向世界；或指使变成那样。","pronunciation":["세ː계화","세ː게화"]},{"id":"0ba34ab95fbb912a","term":"시대","zh":"时代，当代","audio":"/audio/0ba34ab95fbb912ac3c7.mp3","entryId":"65119","definition":"现在的时代；或指问题所在的该时期。","pronunciation":["시대"]},{"id":"fac1f9a42f0b19ea","term":"맞이하다","zh":"迎接，迎","audio":"/audio/fac1f9a42f0b19eaedb8.mp3","entryId":"15924","definition":"面对到来的事物。","pronunciation":["마지하다"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"ec58dce318953718","term":"추구하다","zh":"追求","audio":"/audio/ec58dce3189537184df6.mp3","entryId":"79506","definition":"为达到目的而紧追不舍。","pronunciation":["추구하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"3a57390192c14383","term":"바람직하다","zh":"妥当，可取","audio":"/audio/3a57390192c14383c4c8.mp3","entryId":"15806","definition":"可以认为是好的。","pronunciation":["바람지카다"]},{"id":"62ec56ccb0774e25","term":"민족주의","zh":"民族主义","audio":"/audio/62ec56ccb0774e25bb22.mp3","entryId":"57383","definition":"通过民族独立与统一来实现以民族为中心的政治、文化、经济发展的思想。","pronunciation":["민족쭈의","민족쭈이"]},{"id":"d7895d7647666fe0","term":"방향","zh":"方向，思路","audio":"/audio/d7895d7647666fe00cec.mp3","entryId":"65533","definition":"某事朝着一定目标发展的定向。","pronunciation":["방향"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/a0322cb73232e5f3d961.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57383-1-8-2","ko":"민족의 번영과 발전을 지향하면서도 다른 민족을 차별하거나 배척하지 않는 것이라고 생각합니다.","zh":"我认为，就是在致力于民族繁荣发展的同时，不歧视也不排斥其他民族。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민족의","meaning":"民族","explanation":"민족：民族；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"민족","audio":"/audio/3bac1852f18eeaaf903d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64742","senseId":"1","lemma":"민족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민족의","audio":"/audio/2951d7931785b082d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"번영과","meaning":"繁荣，昌盛，兴盛","explanation":"번영：繁荣，昌盛，兴盛；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"번영","audio":"/audio/8bf9220b81d468e0e572.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59204","senseId":"1","lemma":"번영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번영과","audio":"/audio/2d528eb08b7dbec9e88d.mp3"}},{"text":"발전을","meaning":"发展","explanation":"발전：发展；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발전","audio":"/audio/1bc49bf8cde2146a12e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67880","senseId":"1","lemma":"발전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발전을","audio":"/audio/f1334028f62e15467137.mp3"}},{"text":"지향하면서도","meaning":"向往，憧憬，追求","explanation":"지향하다：向往，憧憬，追求；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"지향하다","audio":"/audio/e96453ea699caf568214.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77827","senseId":"1","lemma":"지향하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지향하면서도","audio":"/audio/ce7a2e4c09f5621e8aab.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"민족을","meaning":"民族","explanation":"민족：民族；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"민족","audio":"/audio/3bac1852f18eeaaf903d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64742","senseId":"1","lemma":"민족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민족을","audio":"/audio/559bb1c6f8910e3012b0.mp3"}},{"text":"차별하거나","meaning":"不平等对待，差别对待，歧视","explanation":"차별하다：不平等对待，差别对待，歧视；거나：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"차별하다","audio":"/audio/482e4d0f8d3f1a64a446.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82471","senseId":"1","lemma":"차별하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차별하거나","audio":"/audio/92c43aeefd17f396ab72.mp3"}},{"text":"배척하지","meaning":"排斥，抵制","explanation":"배척하다：排斥，抵制；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"배척하다","audio":"/audio/f0f672c078c911f41692.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58341","senseId":"1","lemma":"배척하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배척하지","audio":"/audio/383922a11c0b6609260c.mp3"}},{"text":"않는","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않는","audio":"/audio/0770cbaff225bd5dc7f7.mp3"}},{"text":"것이라고","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것이라고","audio":"/audio/1841ca4bdf2981186754.mp3"}},{"text":"생각합니다.","meaning":"认为，当作","explanation":"생각하다：认为，当作；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"7","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각합니다","audio":"/audio/79aecd733f08c3b2f2ee.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bac1852f18eeaaf","term":"민족","zh":"民族","audio":"/audio/3bac1852f18eeaaf903d.mp3","entryId":"64742","definition":"长久以来，在一定地区一起生活并形成固有的语言、文化、历史的人们的集团。","pronunciation":["민족"]},{"id":"8bf9220b81d468e0","term":"번영","zh":"繁荣，昌盛，兴盛","audio":"/audio/8bf9220b81d468e0e572.mp3","entryId":"59204","definition":"某个社会或组织兴旺，物质条件充足。","pronunciation":["버녕"]},{"id":"1bc49bf8cde2146a","term":"발전","zh":"发展","audio":"/audio/1bc49bf8cde2146a12e0.mp3","entryId":"67880","definition":"提升到更好的状态或更高的阶段。","pronunciation":["발쩐"]},{"id":"e96453ea699caf56","term":"지향하다","zh":"向往，憧憬，追求","audio":"/audio/e96453ea699caf568214.mp3","entryId":"77827","definition":"向决定的方向前进。","pronunciation":["지향하다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"482e4d0f8d3f1a64","term":"차별하다","zh":"不平等对待，差别对待，歧视","audio":"/audio/482e4d0f8d3f1a64a446.mp3","entryId":"82471","definition":"对两个以上的对象进行区分，区别对待。","pronunciation":["차별하다"]},{"id":"f0f672c078c911f4","term":"배척하다","zh":"排斥，抵制","audio":"/audio/f0f672c078c911f41692.mp3","entryId":"58341","definition":"因不喜欢而孤立或排挤。","pronunciation":["배처카다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6ffd015ff4c3322a","term":"생각하다","zh":"认为，当作","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3","entryId":"66376","definition":"对某事持有意见或感受。","pronunciation":["생가카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b8217fdfba92c71c02a9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":7.825,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57383","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":179,"sequenceScore":8.3017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["面对全球化时代，我们应当追求怎样的理想民族主义方向呢？","面对全球化时代，我们已经实现了怎样的民族主义目标呢？","面对全球化时代，我们应当放弃民族主义吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我认为，只有排斥其他民族，才能实现本民族的繁荣发展。","我认为，就是在致力于民族繁荣发展的同时，不歧视也不排斥其他民族。","我认为，应该放弃本民族的发展，把其他民族的利益放在首位。"],"answer":1}]}
